00:08:00.771 --> 00:08:01.604
You know why?

00:08:01.604 --> 00:08:05.108
Because I put quality into what I do.

00:08:05.108 --> 00:08:06.858
So if I turn up to a photo shoot,

00:08:06.858 --> 00:08:10.158
