on (language censored)...

00:08:12.548 --> 00:08:13.458
You want to know what?

00:08:13.458 --> 00:08:15.208
No, I am going to leave.

00:08:16.448 --> 00:08:17.615
Is that wrong?

00:08:19.133 --> 00:08:21.883
For wanting more for myself,

00:08:21.883 --> 00:08:24.093
wanting people to treat me with respect?

00:08:24.093 --> 00:08:25.043
But you know what?

00:08:25.043 --> 00:08:27.143
Next time, they know better.

00:08:27.143 --> 00:08:30.143
But had I accepted the pickle juice,

00:08:31.092 --> 00:08:33.268
I would be drinking
pickle juice right now.

00:08:33.268 --> 00:08:36.796
When people see this one
person that's getting a lot

00:08:36.796 --> 00:08:40.313
of shine or notoriety or whatever,

00:08:40.313 --> 00:08:44.688
it makes them feel
unhappy with themselves.

00:08:44.688 --> 00:08:47.313
I mean, ya know, the small-minded people

00:08:47.313 --> 00:08:49.800
feel unhappy with themselves.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:52.723
But the intelligent girls
just take the things

00:08:52.723 --> 00:08:56.054
that they like from me and my journey

00:08:56.054 --> 00:08:59.267
and they apply it to their journey.

00:08:59.267 --> 00:09:02.426
And I think, if I had it my
way, that's what they'd all do.

00:09:02.426 --> 00:09:04.396
I mean, everybody's not
going to like Nicki Minaj.

00:09:04.396 --> 00:09:05.756
You know what I mean?

00:09:05.756 --> 00:09:07.766
Everybody's not going to like
the way look, and what I do.

00:09:07.766 --> 00:09:11.933
But I think if you're smart,
you would take from me,

00:09:12.775 --> 00:09:16.894
and figure out why everybody's
talking about me, ya know.

00:09:16.894 --> 00:09:19.545
I mean that would be
the smart thing to do,

00:09:19.545 --> 00:09:21.465
and I think they don't
know how to express that,

00:09:21.465 --> 00:09:24.375
so they express it with anger,
and jealousy, and hatred,

00:09:24.375 --> 00:09:28.191
and then that consumes
them, and ya know...

00:09:28.191 --> 00:09:29.774
And I'm still here.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.133
