00:09:59.117 --> 00:10:02.155
- One thing I learned along
the way in business is

00:10:02.155 --> 00:10:06.137
the necessity for you to be unapologetic

00:10:06.137 --> 00:10:09.408
about asking for how
much money you deserve.

00:10:09.408 --> 00:10:11.658
At a very early stage in my rap career,

00:10:11.658 --> 00:10:14.431
I was making six figures for shows.

00:10:14.431 --> 00:10:16.932
If I heard there was
another rapper making that,

00:10:16.932 --> 00:10:17.790
I thought, you know what,

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:19.480
I'd get out there and command the crowd.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:22.240
I'd get out there make my fans happy.

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:23.597
I want that too.

00:10:23.597 --> 00:10:25.660
And I think women have
the tendency to feel

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:28.026
