00:10:28.026 --> 00:10:30.376
as much as a man doing
the same exact thing.

00:10:30.376 --> 00:10:32.836
If you know you're great at what you do,

00:10:32.836 --> 00:10:34.373
don't ever be ashamed to ask

00:10:34.373 --> 00:10:36.092
