00:10:36.092 --> 00:10:38.445
Definitely pull inspiration
from your influences.

00:10:38.445 --> 00:10:39.647
I think we all have influences;

00:10:39.647 --> 00:10:41.094
I don't care what anybody says.

00:10:41.094 --> 00:10:43.610
You know, we all have musical influences.

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:44.914
Pull inspiration from them,

00:10:44.914 --> 00:10:46.890
and pull inspiration from your life.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:49.474
You know it's funny; you
don't have to be like

00:10:49.474 --> 00:10:50.673
on some somber (language censored),

00:10:50.673 --> 00:10:52.841
but your regular life is filled

00:10:52.841 --> 00:10:55.495
